                                                "sense_id": "f76c8748-303e-39d3-81fa-465715a199cc",
                                                "text": "There are so many underlinings, so many exclamation points in the margins, and so much highlighting from my many readings and appreciatings that it looks like a case of severe book abuse. It is not; these are marks of love."
